fluxgen (0.1.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release.
  * Multi-client traffic generator inspired by hping3
  * Supports TCP, UDP, ICMP, IGMP, GRE, ESP, AH, SCTP protocols
  * Spoofed IP/MAC addresses per simulated client
  * YAML/JSON configuration file support
  * Traffic capture to PCAP files

